 "description": "{\"ops\":[{\"attributes\":{\"italic\":true},\"insert\":\"Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles \"},{\"insert\":\"brings along just one Commander deck, dubbed \"},{\"attributes\":{\"italic\":true},\"insert\":\"Turtle Power! \"},{\"insert\":\"This five-color deck allows for any combination of \"},{\"insert\":{\"card-link\":\"Leonardo, the Balance\"}},{\"insert\":\" paired up with the titular turtles (and Splinter or April, of course). Alternately, you can select \"},{\"insert\":{\"card-link\":\"Heroes in a Half Shell\"}},{\"insert\":\"as the deck's Commander. \\n\\nThe deck is themed around a number of strategies: Mutant, Ninja, and Turtle Typal, Artifacts matter, Sneak (ninjutsu) and disappear, and Mutagen tokens/+1/+1 counters. Will all these strategies cohere into a functional deck? Experiment in the Playtester to find out!\\n\"}]}",
